cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Optimist Deep Research"
abstract: >-
  An iterative, state-centric agent for autonomous literature research. It
  decomposes a research question into subquestions and search intents,
  retrieves from scholarly sources, canonicalizes and snowballs the corpus,
  reads documents into a structured evidence store, and revises its own
  research plan through a critic before writing a cited report.
type: software
authors:
